The host toolchain in use while this repository was written is Rust 1.92.
tsrs 0.23.0 requires Rust 1.99 and edition 2024, so the verifier does not
link the tsrs crates. When verification.compilerRequired is true, the bridge
runs `tsrs -p <dir> --noEmit` before proof and `tsrs -p <dir>` only after
every required obligation is proved.

A missing binary is VERIFY013. TS_PROOF_SKIP_TSRS=1 and
verification.compilerRequired false are VERIFY014 trusted assumptions.
They are not typecheck successes. --fast is not used.
